    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Nebula Flow, your dog is guiding you through various musical realms. Follow its path by moving and jumping in sync with the music to fill your boost bar. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your boost regularly to clean the road or risk being overwhelmed by increasingly numerous obstacles.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to the end of each song and complete its objectives to unlock more levels! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how you stack up on the leaderboards\u2014beat your friends and rise through the ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling creative? Use the level editor to craft your own challenges and share them with the community on the Workshop.</p><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports keyboard, mouse, and gamepad. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settings for audio latency available. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay elements colors can be customized. </p><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game by Nico and Songe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel art by Daniel &quot;DanieruArt&quot; Reis and Krep_pxl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Original soundtrack by Songe.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Nebula Flow, your dog is guiding you through various musical realms. Follow its path by moving and jumping in sync with the music to fill your boost bar. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your boost regularly to clean the road or risk being overwhelmed by increasingly numerous obstacles.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to the end of each song and complete its objectives to unlock more levels! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how you stack up on the leaderboards\u2014beat your friends and rise through the ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling creative? Use the level editor to craft your own challenges and share them with the community on the Workshop.</p><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports keyboard, mouse, and gamepad. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settings for audio latency available. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay elements colors can be customized. </p><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game by Nico and Songe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel art by Daniel &quot;DanieruArt&quot; Reis and Krep_pxl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Original soundtrack by Songe.</p>",
    "short_description": "Nebula Flow is a music game where you follow the melodic trail charted by your dog across colorful pixel art landscapes. Stock up on notes to power your canine companion to the end of each song!",
